{"code":"PP06","wikidata":"Q73813625","wikipedia":{"en":"Bang Rak Noi Tha It MRT station","th":"สถานีบางรักน้อยท่าอิฐ"},"summary":{"en":"Bang Rak Noi Tha It station is a Bangkok MRT station on the Purple Line. The station opened on 6 August 2016 and is located on Rattanathibet road in Nonthaburi Province. The station has four entrances.","th":"สถานีบางรักน้อยท่าอิฐ เป็นสถานีรถไฟฟ้าลอยฟ้าในเส้นทางสายรถไฟฟ้ามหานคร สายฉลองรัชธรรม ตั้งอยู่เหนือถนนรัตนาธิเบศร์ในเขตอำเภอเมืองนนทบุรี จังหวัดนนทบุรี และมีอาคารจอดแล้วจรที่สามารถจอดรถได้ 1,076 คัน"},"opened":"2016-08-06","photos":[{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/5/5f/201701_Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station.jpg/960px-201701_Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:201701_Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station.jpg","author":"MNXANL","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/b/bb/Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-1.jpg/960px-Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-1.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-1.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/e/e4/Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-2.jpg/960px-Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-2.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-2.jpg","author":"Suikotei","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0"},{"thumb":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/3/35/Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-3.jpg/960px-Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_Station_20230709-3.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=thumbnail","page":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Bang_Rak_Noi_Tha_It_St